# .easignore — appended to .gitignore by EAS Build when uploading the project
# context tarball. Anything listed here is excluded from the build environment.
#
# Keep this tight: EAS needs the mobile app AND the workspace packages it
# imports (@crm/domain, @crm/auth, @crm/config), so DO NOT ignore packages/*,
# pnpm-workspace.yaml, or the workspace root node_modules resolution.
#
# See: https://docs.expo.dev/build-reference/monorepos/#how-to-include-specific-
# files-when-uploading-the-project-to-eas-build

# --- Web app (not part of the mobile build) ---
apps/web
apps/docs
apps/*/web-build
apps/*/dist
apps/*/.next

# --- Secrets / credentials (never ship to EAS build context) ---
# Explicit: any .env file, .env.local*, or credentials.json must never
# reach the EAS build tarball. Belt-and-suspenders with .gitignore.
**/.env*
**/.env.local*
**/credentials.json
**/*.p8
**/*.p12

# --- Node / build artifacts ---
**/node_modules/
**/.expo/
**/dist/
**/build/
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store

# --- Native build outputs (prebuild / EAS local) ---
apps/mobile/ios
apps/mobile/android

# --- Version control & CI ---
.git
.github
.husky

# --- Docs & plans (not needed at build time) ---
docs
*.md
!apps/mobile/README.md
!packages/*/README.md
!pnpm-workspace.yaml

# --- Design / scratch artifacts ---
*.psd
*.sketch
*.fig
